<style>
    @import '../styles/homepage.css';
</style>

<section class="about-gya-section about-gya">
    <p class="about-gya-subtitle">Choosing your aesthetic treatment is personal.<br /> Knowing the person behind the recommendation should be too.</p>
    <div class="container-about-gya">
        <!-- Left Column -->
        <div class="about-gya-left-column">
            <h2 class="about-gya-title">Gya </h2>
            <p class="about-gya-subtitle-3">Founder & Lead Injector</p>
            <h3 class="about-gya-subtitle-2">"Helping you understand your face before recommending any treatment."</h3>
        </div>

        <!-- Middle Column -->
        <div class="about-gya-middle-column">
            <img src="/images/landingPages/about-gya.png" 
                alt="Professional beauty clinic consultation" 
                class=""
                loading="lazy"
            />
         </div>

        <!-- Right Column -->
        <div class="about-gya-right-column">
            <div class="about-gya-right-grid">

                <div class="about-gya-card">
                    <div class="about-gya-card-content">
                        <!-- Flex Element 1 -->
                        <div>
                            <p class="about-gya-card-title">1 Understanding Comes First</p>
                            <p class="about-gya-card-text"> Gya takes time to understand your goals, assess your facial structure and explain what she sees, so every decision is made together.</p>
                            <div class="before-after-divider"></div>
                        </div>
                         
                        <!-- Flex Element 2 -->
                        <div>
                            <p class="about-gya-card-title">A Nurse's Eye For Detail</p>
                            <p class="about-gya-card-text">As a registered nurse with over 10 years of clinical experience, Gya brings a detailed understanding of skin, facial anatomy and safe injection techniques.</p>
                            <div class="before-after-divider"></div>
                        </div>
                        
                        <!-- Flex Element 3 -->
                        <div>
                            <p class="about-gya-card-title">Natural Results Need Careful Planning</p>
                            <p class="about-gya-card-text">Gya considers how your facial features work together before recommending a personalised plan designed to enhance your natural appearance rather than change it.</p>
                            <div class="before-after-divider"></div>
                        </div>
                         
                        <!-- Flex Element 4 -->
                        <div>
                            <p class="about-gya-card-title">Support Beyond Your Appointment</p>
                            <p class="about-gya-card-text">Aftercare guidance, ongoing support and follow-up. Gya is committed to helping you feel informed, comfortable and confident throughout your journey.</p>
                        </div>
                         
                    </div>
                </div>
               
            </div>
        </div>
           
    </div>
</section>

<style>
.about-gya{}

.about-gya-section{
    /*background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.12) 0%, rgba(219, 39, 119, 0.12) 50%, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.08) 100%);*/
    background-color: white;
}

.container-about-gya{
    max-width: 1920px;
    width: calc(100% - clamp(3.125rem, -22.9167rem + 34.7222vw, 18.75rem));
    margin-inline: auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: .88fr 1fr .78fr;
    overflow: clip;
    gap:3rem;
    align-items: center;
}

.about-gya-title{
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    text-align: center;
   
}

.about-gya-subtitle{
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    animation: fadeInUp .6s ease-out both;
    text-align: center;
}



.about-gya-subtitle-2{
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-family: var(--font-primary);
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    animation: fadeInUp .6s ease-out both;
    text-align: center;
    font-style: oblique;
    line-height: 1.4;
}

.about-gya-right-grid{
    margin-inline: auto;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    overflow: clip;
    gap:3rem;
}

.about-gya-card{
    background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 30%, rgba(236, 72, 153, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%), radial-gradient(circle at 80% 70%, rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08) 0%, transparent 50%), radial-gradient(circle at 50% 50%, rgba(249, 115, 22, 0.05) 0%, transparent 50%);
    border: 1px solid #eadfd8;
    border-radius: 1.25rem;
    overflow: hidden;
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
    border: 1px solid rgba(236, 72, 153, .08);
    max-width: 1600px;
}

.about-gya-card-content{
    padding: 1.5rem;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    flex: 1;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
}

.before-after-divider{
    height: 2px;
    background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, rgba(236, 72, 153, .2) 50%, transparent 100%);
    margin: .3rem 0;
}

.about-gya-card-title{
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    position: relative;
    animation: fadeInUp .6s ease-out both;
    text-align: left;
}

.about-gya-card-text{
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
}

.about-gya-subtitle-3{
    font-size: 1.7rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-family: var(--font-primary);
    color: #353535;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    /* position: relative; */
    /* animation: fadeInUp .6s ease-out both; */
    text-align: center;
    /* font-style: oblique; */
    line-height: 1.4;
    font-family: 'Playfair Display';
}
</style>